2931+ 6A0A              .dir_search_len_ge2:
2932+ 6A0A                      ; Is the LAST byte of the name still inside the same physical window?
2933+ 6A0A                      ; last = HL + BC - 1
2934+ 6A0A                      ; Carry means that the name crosses #FFFF -> #C000, therefore use the
2935+ 6A0A                      ; fully bank-safe (but slower) routine below.
2936+ 6A0A E5                   push    hl
2937+ 6A0B C5                   push    bc
2938+ 6A0C 0B                   dec     bc
2939+ 6A0D 09                   add     hl,bc
2940+ 6A0E C1                   pop     bc
2941+ 6A0F E1                   pop     hl
